  "description": "The caster gathers a growing fireball over a burning rune circle, hurls it in an arc, and it detonates on the target in a star of flame: spokes of fire shoot out in every direction, a shockwave rolls across the ground, a fireball billows up, and a wide rayed scorch is left behind.",
