    "reads": {
      "front": "The fireball swells at the caster and arcs away from the camera; at the far end a tall fireball blooms and spokes of flame shoot out and up in every direction before a dark plume rises.",
      "side": "The fireball lobs across in a clear arc trailing flame and lands on the target; the burst is a dome of flame spokes and a rising fireball, with the shockwave flat along the ground.",
      "top": "Hero view. A burning rune circle under the caster marks the wind-up; the fireball streaks to the target; the burst reads as a star: spokes of flame radiating out, a fast shockwave ring, and a wide scorch with soot rays and glowing cracks that stays on the ground.",
